.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Distribute a certain amount of money using\&. 

appropriate dollar bills\&.

.PP
This program receives a whole amount of dollars and distributes it in 20, 10, 5 and 1 dollar bills\&.

.PP
Example: 
.PP
.nf
Enter a dollar amount: 93

$20 bills: 4
$10 bills: 1
 $5 bills: 0
 $1 bills: 3

.fi
.PP
 
.PP
