.SS "int main (void )"

.PP
Program entry point\&. Prompts the user to enter a whole-dollar amount\&. The program computes the required number of $20, $10, $5, and $1 bills using integer division\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Returns a list containing the number of bills for each denomination 

.PP
whose total value equals the amount entered by the user\&. 
.RE
